            "review_title": "Review at Material Cafe",
            "review_text": "Lyn L\n2 contributions\n0\nPancake Afternoon\nMar 2020 • Friends\nSoft and puffy pancakes! Taste like soufflé, quite a special experience. Reasonably priced, ambient atmosphere, good place for gathering and relaxation.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 1, 2020\nMaterial Cafe\nThank you very much for visiting Material Cafe.\nI am really happy to have a nice review.\nWe will continue to strive to satisfy not only pancakes but also all dishes, drinks, services, environment and price.\nWe look forward to seeing you again.\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
