            "review_title": "Review at Material Cafe",
            "review_text": "Jean\n12 contributions\n0\nA Must Visit\nJul 2019 • Solo\nThere were lots of beautiful cafes in Ho Chi Min City - Vietnam, including a couple of Japanese theme cafes.\n\nMaterial Cafe was one of those with very beautiful ambient, environment, food and extremely friendly staffs, that I came twice despite my short stay and couldn't help to chill out here...\n\nService was great too!\nGreen tea was served before I even ordered anything, which surprised me.\n\nHashed Beef & (Fluffy Japanese) Pancakes are their specialty. Definitely a must try!\n\n3 levels of space with different interior design also gives you a choice to hang out in whichever level that suits your mood.\n\nI unexpectedly chance upon this cafe while on my way to a conference at Le Meridien Saigon hotel. \n\nI was very impressed with the cafe and started taking pictures for keepsake but ended up meeting the bosses of the cafe and they greeted me with amazing hospitality!~\n\nIt is definitely a place worth visiting!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 11, 2019\nMaterial Cafe\nThank you for your high evaluation.\nWe will continue to make further improvements to make the store comfortable for our customers.\nWe look forward to seeing you again.\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
